      "name": "Haltech IO 12 Expander",
      "maker": "Haltech",
      "pretends": "Haltech IO 12 Expander",
      "blurb": "4 analog inputs, 4 switch inputs, and the 4 outputs the ECU sends back. Give each input any buttons and voltages you like.",
